@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title PUT /api/workspace/v1/messenger/drafts/{draft_uuid}
actor "The client ." as Client
participant "Controller is RestAlchemy" as API
database "The draft line in PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "Internal domain name outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\ninternal/no public derivative" as TASK
Client -> API: PUT payload + If-Match
API -> DB: BEGIN; block the owner 's draft
API -> DB: Compare the revision; I 'm going to update it . payload + revision
API -> OUT: Adding an internal draft.updated
API -> DB: COMMIT
OUT -> TASK: immutable delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
note right of TASK: effect guard; Finish without public event row
API --> Client: 200 Draft + new ETag
@enduml
